+## Group 9: Settings, Language & Notifications
+
+### 1. Features Implemented & Resolved
+- **Multi-Language Preferences & Locale Application (`SettingsActivity.java` / `LocaleHelper.java`)**:
+  - Supports six regional language choices: English (`en`), Kannada (`kn`), Hindi (`hi`), Tamil (`ta`), Telugu (`te`), and Malayalam (`ml`).
+  - Language selection persists in `TokenManager` preference store and updates `Configuration` locale via `LocaleHelper`.
+  - Added unit test suite `SettingsLanguageTest.java` verifying language code mappings, locale resolution, and default fallback handling.
+- **Reminders & Notification Permissions (`RemindersActivity.java` / `ReminderScheduler.java`)**:
+  - Schedules period and ovulation window reminders in `ReminderScheduler` with discreet notification text.
+  - Supports medication reminder creation, listing, and deletion with local SQLite persistence (`KEY_REMINDER_TITLE`, `KEY_REMINDER_TIME`).
+  - Handles Android 13+ (`POST_NOTIFICATIONS`) runtime permission checks and `ACTION_BOOT_COMPLETED` alarm restoration in `NotificationReceiver`. Verified in `RemindersTest.java`.
+
+---
+
+## Group 8: Profile Picture Selection & Persistence
+
+### 1. Features Implemented & Resolved
+- **System Photo Picker & Compressed JPEG Storage (`ProfileFragment.java`)**:
+  - Integrated Android system photo picker via `ActivityResultContracts.PickVisualMedia`.
+  - Resizes and compresses selected photos to JPEG format stored safely in app-private internal storage (`context.getFilesDir()`).
+- **User Email Preference Path Isolation (`AppPreferences.java`)**:
+  - Persists image path using `saveProfileImagePath(userEmail, path)`, keying storage per user email (`PREFIX_PROFILE_IMAGE + userEmail`) so separate user accounts do not share avatars.
+  - Added unit test suite `ProfileAvatarTest.java` testing preference path isolation, account separation, and missing file fallback.
+- **Avatar Display with Fallback (`ProfileFragment.java` / `HomeFragment.java`)**:
+  - Renders saved avatar in both profile and home screens using `BitmapFactory.decodeFile`.
+  - Falls back gracefully to `ic_person` vector drawable when no photo is set or file is unavailable.
+
+---
+
+## Group 7: Quiz & Health Education
+
+### 1. Features Implemented & Resolved
+- **Quiz Progression, Option Validation & Double-Tap Guard (`QuizActivity.java`)**:
+  - Implemented `isSubmitting` click guard and button disabling on the "Next Question" button to prevent rapid double-tap submissions.
+  - Validates option selection (`rgOptions.getCheckedRadioButtonId() == -1`), alerting user when no answer is selected.
+  - Calculates score, displays correct/incorrect toasts, and shows score summary `AlertDialog` on completion with a retry reset option.
+  - Preserved remote quiz fetching via `ApiService.QUIZZES` with a 10-question WHO/ACOG/CDC educational fallback.
+  - Added unit test suite `QuizTest.java` verifying question DTO getters/setters, score calculation, index progression, and retry resets.
+- **External Research Links (`AwarenessDetailActivity.java`)**:
+  - Dynamically renders research buttons targeting PubMed, Google Scholar, MedlinePlus, Wikipedia, and Google Search via `Intent.ACTION_VIEW`.
+
